Third-party data

lib/data/gamecontrollerdb.txt is the SDL_GameControllerDB gamepad mapping
database (https://github.com/mdqinc/SDL_GameControllerDB). It is NOT under
the MIT license above: it keeps its own license (zlib), whose text is in
lib/data/gamecontrollerdb-LICENSE.txt.
